=== layout: section

# Exact Monohybrid Crosses

=== layout: one-panel

# Exactly three dominant offspring

@body

- Aa &times; Aa; four independent offspring
- P(A-) = 3/4; P(aa) = 1/4

*P(3 A- and 1 aa) = C(4,3) &times; (3/4)^3^ &times; (1/4)*

= 27/64 &asymp; 42.2%

=== layout: one-panel

# Mendel's pea seed color

@body

- Yellow seed color is dominant to green.
- Six offspring from a heterozygote cross
- k = number with yellow seeds

*P(k) = C(6,k) &times; (3/4)^k^ &times; (1/4)^(6-k)^*

Calculate all seven outcomes: k = 0 through 6.

