=== layout: one-panel

# Key ideas to keep

@body

- Condition on survival before calculating litter probabilities.
- Count arrangements; multiply by the probability of one arrangement.
- More than two categories: use multinomial reasoning.
- Exact expected ratios can be uncommon in small samples.

